.env*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
data/raw/
.playwright-mcp/

# Vultr deployment: the API key, the OpenTofu state (it holds the endpoint's
# bearer token) and the downloaded providers stay local. The lock file is not
# committed because it was generated from a local provider mirror, so its
# checksums differ from the registry's; a normal `tofu init` regenerates it.
infra/vultr/api-key
infra/vultr/.terraform/
infra/vultr/.terraform.lock.hcl
infra/vultr/*.tfstate
infra/vultr/*.tfstate.*
